{
  "id": "1144",
  "title": "Don’t Do the Difficult Questions",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-12-19",
  "synopsis": "Mom’s advice to Little Ming is to skip the difficult questions to leave time for the easy ones. But what if there are no easy questions?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1144/bef657a992a4a53bfc22b21f496e273597115fb1.mp3?1605618360",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "难的题不做\n\n妈妈：这次考试的题你怎么一题都没做？\n小明：你不是说难的题就不用做了吗？\n妈妈：我是说你觉得很难的题就不用做了，可以把时间留给不难的题。\n小明：可是我觉得所有的题都很难！",
    "traditional": "難的題不做\n\n媽媽：這次考試的題你怎麼一題都沒做？\n小明：你不是說難的題就不用做了嗎？\n媽媽：我是說你覺得很難的題就不用做了，可以把時間留給不難的題。\n小明：可是我覺得所有的題都很難！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Don’t Do the Difficult Questions"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈：这次考试的题你怎么一题都没做？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：這次考試的題你怎麼一題都沒做？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma zhè cì kǎo shì de tí nǐ zěn me yì tí dōu méi zuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Why didn’t you do a single question in the test?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明：你不是说难的题就不用做了吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：你不是說難的題就不用做了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nǐ bú shì shuō nán de tí jiù bú yòng zuò le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Didn’t you say that I don’t need to do the hard questions."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：我是说你觉得很难的题就不用做了，",
      "traditional": "媽媽：我是說你覺得很難的題就不用做了，",
      "pinyin": "mā ma wǒ shì shuō nǐ jué de hěn nán de tí jiù bú yòng zuò le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "可以把时间留给不难的题。",
      "traditional": "可以把時間留給不難的題。",
      "pinyin": "kě yǐ bǎ shí jiān liú gěi bù nán de tí",
      "english": "Mom: I said that you don’t need to do the questions that you find very difficult."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So you can leave time for the questions that aren’t difficult."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "小明：可是我觉得所有的题都很难！",
      "traditional": "小明：可是我覺得所有的題都很難！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng kě shì wǒ jué de suǒ yǒu de tí dōu hěn nán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: But I thought that all of the questions were very difficult!"
    }
  ],
